OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment to publish changes to
OL,4,ATroubles legacy bill next month, Sinn
OL,5,AFein says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government has indicated that it
OL,8,Fwill publish its planned changes to the
OL,9,FTroubles legacy bill in the middle of
OL,10,Fnext month, Sinn Fein has said.
OL,12,FThe party's North Belfast MP John
OL,13,FFinucane was speaking on Thursday after
OL,14,Fmeeting the Secretary of State, Sir
OL,15,FChris Bryant, to discuss the proposals.
OL,17,FSir Chris is holding a range of
OL,18,Fmeetings with the largest Stormont
OL,19,Fparties throughout the day.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
