OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment to publish changes to
OL,4,ATroubles legacy bill next month, Sinn
OL,5,AFein says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government has faced criticism for
OL,8,Fdelays in passing the Troubles legacy
OL,9,Fbill, which was introduced last year,
OL,10,Ffollowing agreement on a joint
OL,11,Fframework with the Irish government.
